218
00:09:47,379 --> 00:09:49,617
1,002 pounds of cocaine.

219
00:09:49,617 --> 00:09:51,667
More than $20 million.

220
00:09:52,117 --> 00:09:54,750
Federal prosecutors called it a tremendous

221
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:57,321
amount of drugs, even by the standards of

222
00:09:57,321 --> 00:09:58,261
their district.

223
00:09:59,061 --> 00:10:02,387
The driver, a 44-year-old man and the truck's

224
00:10:02,387 --> 00:10:06,082
