225
00:10:06,082 --> 00:10:07,708
He pleaded not guilty.

226
00:10:07,708 --> 00:10:11,181
The charge carries a 10-year mandatory minimum.

227
00:10:11,181 --> 00:10:14,507
He is presumed innocent unless proven guilty.

228
00:10:14,957 --> 00:10:17,950
The case belongs to the California Homeland

229
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:20,595
Security Task Force, part of a Justice

230
00:10:20,595 --> 00:10:23,588
Department initiative called Operation Take

231
00:10:23,588 --> 00:10:24,493
Back America.

232
00:10:24,943 --> 00:10:26,978
And at the time, it was only the

233
00:10:26,978 --> 00:10:29,396
second-biggest cocaine seizure in that

234
00:10:29,396 --> 00:10:30,604
district this year.

235
00:10:30,604 --> 00:10:33,213
The biggest, in May, was more than a ton,

236
00:10:33,213 --> 00:10:35,503
