248
00:11:07,146 --> 00:11:09,130
Four crossings. Five loads.

249
00:11:09,580 --> 00:11:12,746
Peppers and cucumbers in Pharr:

250
00:11:12,746 --> 00:11:14,891
1,635 pounds of meth.

251
00:11:14,891 --> 00:11:16,729
Rebar in Calexico:

252
00:11:16,729 --> 00:11:19,180
1,002 pounds of cocaine.

253
00:11:19,630 --> 00:11:21,619
Cucumbers in Nogales:

254
00:11:21,619 --> 00:11:23,798
254 pounds of fentanyl.

255
00:11:23,798 --> 00:11:27,303
Medical supplies in Otay Mesa, twice:

256
00:11:27,303 --> 00:11:31,281
more than 3,000 pounds of meth, then about

257
00:11:31,281 --> 00:11:32,323
2,400 more.

258
00:11:32,773 --> 00:11:35,646
Every one of them was found the same way.

259
00:11:35,646 --> 00:11:38,099
A second look, an image, and a dog.

260
00:11:38,099 --> 00:11:40,832
And nationwide, as of fiscal 2024, most

261
00:11:40,832 --> 00:11:44,336
arriving trucks never go through a scanner at all.

262
00:11:44,786 --> 00:11:46,914
These are the loads that got caught.

263
00:11:46,914 --> 00:11:49,159
Nobody can count the ones that didn't.

264
00:11:49,609 --> 00:11:51,051
Case file 013.

265
00:11:51,051 --> 00:11:52,596
Closed for now.
